<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1716254220"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Biri-Biri"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YOASOBI"/><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.300"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">从说出“初次见面”的那天起</text><text for="L2">就一直等待着</text><text for="L3">心心念念着这一天</text><text for="L4">闪闪发光 栖居在你眼中的</text><text for="L5">光芒 我看见了</text><text for="L6">走过这片广袤的大地</text><text for="L7">与新的人相遇 一定</text><text for="L8">能找到</text><text for="L9">只属于你的宝石</text><text for="L10">把那道轨迹存档</text><text for="L11">全部 全部</text><text for="L12">Hurry up!</text><text for="L13">红蓝绿 色彩缤纷</text><text for="L14">寻宝途中 偶尔绕绕远路</text><text for="L15">想和你过过招 那就一起吧</text><text for="L16">3.2.1!</text><text for="L17">“就决定是你了！”</text><text for="L18">今天也拉开了帷幕</text><text for="L19">Let me 没错 Let me feel</text><text for="L20">怦怦的心跳 已经</text><text for="L21">停不下来 拦也拦不住</text><text for="L22">不断打磨的</text><text for="L23">酥麻带电的一击 就在此刻</text><text for="L24">凝神瞄准</text><text for="L25">Keep it, keep it up!</text><text for="L26">来吧 Pick out...</text><text for="L27">要飞奔过这硕果累累的瞬间</text><text for="L28">走吧 No limit 管它什么上限</text><text for="L29">酥麻带电</text><text for="L30">此刻与你</text><text for="L31">那份焦灼</text><text for="L32">Give me, Give me, more</text><text for="L33">火辣辣的</text><text for="L34">Living, Living, oh</text><text for="L35">就连千钧一发</text><text for="L36">也要尽情享受</text><text for="L37">金银 水晶</text><text for="L38">我想要的 才不是那些</text><text for="L39">新人？馆主？</text><text for="L40">是谁都无所谓啦</text><text for="L41">苍天之下 越过绿宝石的海</text><text for="L42">寻出那唯一的一点红</text><text for="L43">难解的谜题 直接跳过</text><text for="L44">去往藏着趣味的小镇</text><text for="L45">分出黑白 一决胜负</text><text for="L46">若论我拿手的对战 How to</text><text for="L47">从 ABC 到 XYZ</text><text for="L48">我遇见了你</text><text for="L49">终于与你重逢</text><text for="L50">Let me 没错 Let me feel</text><text for="L51">正怦怦直跳</text><text for="L52">你也一样吗</text><text for="L53">阳光倾洒的清晨也好</text><text for="L54">望得见月亮的夜晚也好</text><text for="L55">一路积累下来的</text><text for="L56">尽情碰撞吧</text><text for="L57">认真一决胜负</text><text for="L58">无论如何 都再也停不下来</text><text for="L59">梦中所见的</text><text for="L60">在这个舞台上</text><text for="L61">“就决定是你了！”</text><text for="L62">这望眼欲穿的时刻 来吧</text><text for="L63">扑通扑通</text><text for="L64">朝着心跳传来的前方 走吧</text><text for="L65">不断打磨的</text><text for="L66">酥麻带电的一击 就在此刻</text><text for="L67">凝神瞄准</text><text for="L68">Keep it, keep it up!</text><text for="L69">来吧 Pick out...</text><text for="L70">让此刻硕果累累</text><text for="L71">无论何时 都 No limit 管它什么上限</text><text for="L72">一脸高冷的你也好</text><text for="L73">怕生的你也好</text><text for="L74">向垂头丧气的过去 说声拜拜</text><text for="L75">把未来 GET！</text><text for="L76">酥麻带电</text><text for="L77">此刻与你</text><text for="L78">那份焦灼</text><text for="L79">Give me, Give me, more</text><text for="L80">火辣辣的</text><text for="L81">Living, Living, oh</text><text for="L82">就连千钧一发</text><text for="L83">也要尽情享受</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:07.326"><div begin="12.363" end="23.064" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="12.363" end="14.280" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.363" end="13.452">「はじめまして」</span><span begin="13.452" end="13.693">した</span><span begin="13.693" end="14.280">日から</span></p><p begin="14.395" end="15.839" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.395" end="14.977">ずっと</span><span begin="14.977" end="15.470">待って</span><span begin="15.470" end="15.839">いた</span></p><p begin="16.730" end="18.715" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.730" end="17.107">この</span><span begin="17.270" end="17.554">日を</span><span begin="17.616" end="18.316">想って</span><span begin="18.316" end="18.715">いた</span></p><p begin="18.758" end="21.079" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.758" end="19.722">キラキラ</span><span begin="19.722" end="19.990">その</span><span begin="19.990" end="20.385">目に</span><span begin="20.385" end="21.079">宿った</span></p><p begin="21.128" end="23.064" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.128" end="21.944">光</span><span begin="21.944" end="22.291">を</span><span begin="22.291" end="23.064">見たんだ</span></p></div><div begin="23.178" end="34.094" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.178" end="25.865" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.178" end="23.903">広がる</span><span begin="23.903" end="24.359">この</span><span begin="24.359" end="25.116">大地を</span><span begin="25.116" end="25.865">歩いて</span></p><p begin="25.996" end="28.696" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.996" end="26.641">新たな</span><span begin="26.641" end="27.389">出会いに</span><span begin="27.389" end="27.968">触れて</span><span begin="27.968" end="28.696">きっと</span></p><p begin="28.796" end="29.981" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.796" end="29.242">見つけ</span><span begin="29.242" end="29.551">出</span><span begin="29.551" end="29.981">せる</span></p><p begin="30.094" end="31.415" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.094" end="30.362">きみ</span><span begin="30.362" end="30.863">だけの</span><span begin="30.863" end="31.415">ジュエル</span></p><p begin="31.546" end="32.775" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.546" end="31.694">その</span><span begin="31.694" end="32.299">軌跡を</span><span begin="32.299" end="32.775">セーブ</span></p><p begin="32.962" end="34.094" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.962" end="33.432">全部</span><span begin="33.432" end="34.094">全部</span></p></div><div begin="34.094" end="44.907" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="34.094" end="35.136" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.094" end="34.880">Hurry</span> <span begin="34.880" end="35.136">up!</span></p><p begin="35.179" end="37.878" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.179" end="35.905">赤青</span><span begin="35.905" end="36.417">緑</span><span begin="36.417" end="36.920">色</span><span begin="36.920" end="37.460">とり</span><span begin="37.460" end="37.878">どり</span></p><p begin="37.946" end="40.649" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.946" end="38.992">宝探し</span> <span begin="38.992" end="39.579">たまに</span><span begin="39.579" end="40.187">寄り</span><span begin="40.187" end="40.649">道</span></p><p begin="40.730" end="43.430" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.730" end="41.491">手合わせ</span><span begin="41.491" end="42.017">願う</span> <span begin="42.017" end="42.669">それじゃ</span><span begin="42.669" end="43.430">一緒に</span></p><p begin="43.430" end="44.907" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.430" end="43.875">3.</span><span begin="43.991" end="44.466">2.</span><span begin="44.517" end="44.907">1!</span></p></div><div begin="45.628" end="1:08.990" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="45.628" end="46.894" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.628" end="46.158">「キミに</span><span begin="46.158" end="46.894">きめた！」</span></p><p begin="47.885" end="49.714" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.885" end="48.497">今日も</span><span begin="48.497" end="49.003">幕が</span><span begin="49.003" end="49.714">開けた</span></p><p begin="50.762" end="51.962" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.762" end="51.046">Let me</span><span begin="51.046" end="51.280">そう</span><span begin="51.280" end="51.568">Let me</span> <span begin="51.568" end="51.962">feel</span></p><p begin="53.459" end="54.677" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.459" end="54.346">ドキドキが</span><span begin="54.346" end="54.677">もう</span></p><p begin="54.777" end="56.544" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.777" end="55.542">止まらない</span><span begin="55.542" end="56.544">止められない</span></p><p begin="56.743" end="57.892"